									<h3 class="uppercase head-4"><span class="main-color">Get Ready </span>For Success</h3>
									<p class="sub-heading">Luzerne County Community College (LCCC) is an accredited public college offering 2-year associate of arts, associate of science, and associate of applied science degrees as well as certificates of specialization and diplomas in more than 100 academic major programs.</p>
								</div>
								<ul class="list">
