                                <div class="heading sub-head">
                                    <h3 class="bolder head-4 uppercase">Recent <span class="main-color">Posts</span></h3>
                                </div>
                                
                                <div class="row posts-mini">
                                    <!--My Story-->
                                    <div class="col-md-6 post-item"><div class="post-image"><a href="mystory/readmore.jsp?id=49"><img src="mystory/images/photo49.jpg" alt="LCCC My Story"></a></div><article class="post-content"><div class="post-info-container"><div class="post-info"><strong><a href="mystory/readmore.jsp?id=49">Alumna Spotlight: Dr. Lynette Kuhn'10</a></strong><ul class="post-meta"></ul></div></div><p>Dr. Lynette Kuhn's story is one defined by perseverance, purpose, and the transformative power of education.  <a class="more_btn main-color" href="mystory/readmore.jsp?id=49">Read more</a></p></article></div><div class="col-md-6 post-item"><div class="post-image"><a href="spotlight/readmore.jsp?id=89"><img src="spotlight/images/photo89.jpg" alt="LCCC Spotlight"></a></div><article class="post-content"><div class="post-info-container"><div class="post-info"><strong><a href="spotlight/readmore.jsp?id=89">LCCC Honored with Community Advancement Award at STARS of the Valley</a></strong><ul class="post-meta"></ul></div></div><p>LCCC was recognized for its commitment to workforce development, educational innovation, and community impact by receiving the Community Advancement Award at the Greater Wyoming Valley Chamber of Commerce's second annual STARS of the Valley Awards. <a class="more_btn main-color" href="spotlight/readmore.jsp?id=89">Read more</a></p></article></div>                                    
                                    
                                </div>
                                
                            </div>
                            
                            <div class="col-md-4">								
                                <div class="heading sub-head">
                                    <h3 class="bolder head-4 uppercase">Testimonials</h3>
                                </div>
                                <div class="testimonials shape horizontal-slider normal-testimonials gry-bg padding-horizontal-20 padding-vertical-20" data-slides_count="1" data-scroll_amount="1" data-slider-speed="400" data-slider-arrows="1" data-slider-auto="0" data-slider-infinite="1" data-slider-dots="1">
                                    <div class="testimonials-bg">
                                        <div class="testimonials-img">
                                            <img alt="Testimonial from Tommy McFly Pavlick" src="assets/images/testimonials/1.jpg">
                                        </div>
                                        <p>"The media and broadcast department at LCCC is fantastic. The instructors simultaneously worked in the field. They treated me like a peer, not some kid."</p>
                                        <div class="testimonials-name">
                                            <strong>Tommy "McFly" Pavlick '06</strong>
                                            <br>
                                        </div>
                                    </div>
                                    <div class="testimonials-bg">
