                                        </div>
                                        <p>"LCCC was affordable and gave me the start I needed to find my direction and earn my degree."</p>
                                        <div class="testimonials-name">
                                            <strong>Christine Stevens- Slacktish '90</strong>
                                            <br>
                                        </div>
                                    </div>
                                    <div class="testimonials-bg">
                                        <div class="testimonials-img">
